[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7748.069, "timestamp": "02:09:08", "text": "我以为我已经是奥托了。 Otto 如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7757.109, "timestamp": "02:09:17", "text": "你指的是哪一个？好的，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7758.55, "timestamp": "02:09:18", "text": "是的。所以，我当时想做的其中一件事是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7763.27, "timestamp": "02:09:23", "text": "想得对，所以，嗯，今天我做了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7766.31, "timestamp": "02:09:26", "text": "人们使用感叹号提醒 jock"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7770.069, "timestamp": "02:09:30", "text": "那个东西，它会像提醒一样发送信息"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7773.189, "timestamp": "02:09:33", "text": "好的，不说这个提醒了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7775.75, "timestamp": "02:09:35", "text": "嵌入并说出他们想要的数字"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7779.43, "timestamp": "02:09:39", "text": "下次我会这样做，嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7781.75, "timestamp": "02:09:41", "text": "是一样的，但它会有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7785.03, "timestamp": "02:09:45", "text": "装饰图片，他们选择了什么装饰？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7788.149, "timestamp": "02:09:48", "text": "或者类似上帝这样的存在，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7790.149, "timestamp": "02:09:50", "text": "我想我可以和萨米安排一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7794.629, "timestamp": "02:09:54", "text": "是的。然后，我又想到了另一个主意："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7797.51, "timestamp": "02:09:57", "text": "如果想象"}]